---
description: Reconcile architecture, sample data, security and supported integration evidence.
args:{goal:GoalContract;policy:PolicySelection;outcomes:OnboardingOutcome[];evidence:EvidencePage[]}
returns:EnvironmentAssessment
---
Map each accepted outcome to its system, interface, access requirement and supporting evidence. Distinguish verified capability from assumption and record unknown interfaces as discovery tasks. Keep credentials out of the evidence set; access questions use non-secret configuration facts. Mark sample/production discrepancy as a blocker for dependent imports.
